  "Cappadocia Hotel Guide: 12 Featured Stays to Compare": {
    "sources": [
      "/articles/cappadocia-hotel-guide/"
    ],
    "contexts": [
      "title",
      "meta@content",
      "span",
      "h1"
    ],
    "count": 5
  },
  "Start in Göreme with Sultan Cave Suites, Aza Cave Hotel and Kelebek Special Cave Hotel. Our twelve-hotel selection continues in the order shown below, with other Göreme stays and choices in Uçhisar and Çavuşin. Open the specific property on Booking.com to compare your dates, guests, room and cancellation conditions. This is a preferred selection, not a score-based ranking or a claim that every property suits every traveller.": {
    "sources": [
      "/articles/cappadocia-hotel-guide/"
    ],
    "contexts": [
      "p"
    ],
    "count": 1
  },
  "Göreme: Sultan, Aza and Kelebek": {
    "sources": [
      "/articles/cappadocia-hotel-guide/"
    ],
    "contexts": [
      "h2",
      "a"
    ],
    "count": 2
  },
  "Illustrated Cappadocia field note for Cappadocia Hotel Guide: 12 Featured Stays to Compare": {
    "sources": [
      "/articles/cappadocia-hotel-guide/"
    ],
    "contexts": [
      "div@aria-label"
    ],
    "count": 1
  },
  "More choices in Göreme and Çavuşin": {
    "sources": [
      "/articles/cappadocia-hotel-guide/"
    ],
    "contexts": [
      "strong",
      "h2",
      "a"
    ],
    "count": 3
  },
  "In Göreme, continue with Artemis Cave Suites, Henna Hotel and Aydınlı Cave Hotel; Cappadocia Cave Suites and Carus Cappadocia are also part of our selection. Compare the exact room and access to the facilities you want. Aza, Artemis and Henna list adult-focused guest policies, so check the current minimum age before planning a family stay.": {
    "sources": [
      "/articles/cappadocia-hotel-guide/"
    ],
    "contexts": [
      "p"
    ],
    "count": 1
  },
  "Seki Cave Hotel is in Çavuşin. It is a separate hotel from Seki Restaurant at Argos in Cappadocia. Check the journey to your planned dinners and activities, as well as the route from the vehicle drop-off to your room. For every property, ask about windows, ventilation, stairs and your actual bed arrangement.": {
    "sources": [
      "/articles/cappadocia-hotel-guide/"
    ],
    "contexts": [
      "p"
    ],
    "count": 1
  },
  "Use each hotel’s Booking.com button to compare the same dates and guest count. The card opens that specific property, rather than a general hotel results page. Check the final total, breakfast, taxes, cancellation conditions and any deposit before paying.": {
    "sources": [
      "/articles/cappadocia-hotel-guide/"
    ],
    "contexts": [
      "p"
    ],
    "count": 1
  },
  "If you need more options, use the Cappadocia accommodation search below the selection. The current offer is confirmed on Booking.com; this guide does not promise a fixed rate or available room. Arrange airport transport with your arriving flight number and your return flight number when booked.": {
    "sources": [
      "/articles/cappadocia-hotel-guide/"
    ],
    "contexts": [
      "p"
    ],
    "count": 1
  },
