  "We count page views, broad referral categories and clicks on our GetYourGuide and Booking.com affiliate links in daily aggregates retained for 90 days. We do not store IP addresses, full referrer URLs, search queries or visitor identifiers in these aggregates, and do not set analytics cookies. Around 20% of eligible visits send real page-performance measurements (LCP, CLS and INP); only performance bands are retained. Our measurement honours Do Not Track and Global Privacy Control. Counts are not unique visitors or confirmed bookings.": {
    "sources": [
      "/privacy/"
    ],
    "contexts": [
      "p"
    ],
    "count": 1
  },
  "GetYourGuide and Booking.com widgets load when their section approaches the viewport. Booking.com placements also use CJ tracking links and impression pixels. These external services receive requests from your browser and apply their own privacy and cookie policies. Our Do Not Track setting controls our own measurement, not an external service. We do not receive payment-card details or complete reservations. If a widget is unavailable, the labelled booking link remains available.": {
    "sources": [
      "/privacy/"
    ],
    "contexts": [
      "p"
    ],
    "count": 1
  }
